{"seq":1,"slug":"module-boundaries","title":"模块边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/module-boundaries","wordCount":871,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块边界\">模块边界</h1><p>在大型 iOS 项目中，合理定义模块边界是架构健康的基石。本文介绍模块类型划分、依赖方向设计、公开 API 控制以及无环依赖原则。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模块边界回答的是「哪些代码放在一起、哪些代码必须隔开」的问题，它由三个相互支撑的概念构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>模块类型划分</strong>：按职责把模块分为功能模块、基础模块等类别</li>\n<li><strong>依赖方向</strong>：依赖只能指向更稳定的下层，不允许反向或循环依赖</li>\n<li><strong>公开 API 控制</strong>：模块只暴露必要的接口，内部实现对外不可见</li>\n<li><strong>无环依赖原则（ADP）</strong>：模块依赖图必须是 DAG，不能出现环</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中依赖方向是纲领：一旦允许反向依赖或成环，模块就失去独立演进与独立编译的能力。公开 API 控制则是它的落地手段——通过 <code>internal</code> 与最小化的接口，防止外部代码侵入模块内部。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模块类型\">模块类型</h2><p>iOS 模块化项目通常将模块分为三大类：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Feature[&quot;功能模块 Feature&quot;]&#10;        Home&#10;        Profile&#10;        Search&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Core[&quot;核心模块 Core&quot;]&#10;        Networking&#10;        Storage&#10;        Analytics&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Shared[&quot;共享模块 Shared&quot;]&#10;        UIComponents&#10;        Extensions&#10;        Models&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Home --&gt; Networking&#10;    Home --&gt; UIComponents&#10;    Profile --&gt; Storage&#10;    Profile --&gt; UIComponents&#10;    Search --&gt; Networking&#10;    Search --&gt; Models&#10;    Networking --&gt; Extensions&#10;    Storage --&gt; Extensions&#10;&#10;    classDef feat fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef core fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef shared fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class Home,Profile,Search feat&#10;    class Networking,Storage,Analytics core&#10;    class UIComponents,Extensions,Models shared\">graph TD\n    subgraph Feature[\"功能模块 Feature\"]\n        Home\n        Profile\n        Search\n    end\n    subgraph Core[\"核心模块 Core\"]\n        Networking\n        Storage\n        Analytics\n    end\n    subgraph Shared[\"共享模块 Shared\"]\n        UIComponents\n        Extensions\n        Models\n    end\n\n    Home --&gt; Networking\n    Home --&gt; UIComponents\n    Profile --&gt; Storage\n    Profile --&gt; UIComponents\n    Search --&gt; Networking\n    Search --&gt; Models\n    Networking --&gt; Extensions\n    Storage --&gt; Extensions\n\n    classDef feat fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef core fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef shared fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class Home,Profile,Search feat\n    class Networking,Storage,Analytics core\n    class UIComponents,Extensions,Models shared</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块类型</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Feature（功能模块）</td>\n<td>封装独立业务功能，包含 UI 和业务逻辑</td>\n<td>首页、个人中心、搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Core（核心模块）</td>\n<td>提供基础设施能力，无业务逻辑</td>\n<td>网络层、存储层、埋点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shared（共享模块）</td>\n<td>跨模块复用的工具和组件</td>\n<td>UI 组件库、扩展方法、公共模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖方向\">依赖方向</h2><p>模块间的依赖必须遵循严格的方向规则，避免循环依赖：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    App[&quot;App(壳工程)&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt; Feature1[&quot;Feature A&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt; Feature2[&quot;Feature B&quot;]&#10;    Feature1 --&gt; Core1[&quot;Core X&quot;]&#10;    Feature2 --&gt; Core1&#10;    Feature1 --&gt; Shared1[&quot;Shared&quot;]&#10;    Feature2 --&gt; Shared1&#10;    Core1 --&gt; Shared1&#10;&#10;    classDef app fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;    classDef feat fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef core fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef shared fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class App app&#10;    class Feature1,Feature2 feat&#10;    class Core1 core&#10;    class Shared1 shared\">graph TD\n    App[\"App(壳工程)\"]\n    App --&gt; Feature1[\"Feature A\"]\n    App --&gt; Feature2[\"Feature B\"]\n    Feature1 --&gt; Core1[\"Core X\"]\n    Feature2 --&gt; Core1\n    Feature1 --&gt; Shared1[\"Shared\"]\n    Feature2 --&gt; Shared1\n    Core1 --&gt; Shared1\n\n    classDef app fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n    classDef feat fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef core fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef shared fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class App app\n    class Feature1,Feature2 feat\n    class Core1 core\n    class Shared1 shared</pre><p>依赖规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Feature → Core</strong> ✅ 功能模块可以依赖核心模块</li>\n<li><strong>Feature → Shared</strong> ✅ 功能模块可以依赖共享模块</li>\n<li><strong>Core → Shared</strong> ✅ 核心模块可以依赖共享模块</li>\n<li><strong>Feature → Feature</strong> ❌ 功能模块之间不能直接依赖</li>\n<li><strong>Core → Feature</strong> ❌ 核心模块不能依赖功能模块</li>\n<li><strong>Shared → Core/Feature</strong> ❌ 共享模块不能依赖上层模块</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Feature 之间的通信应通过接口模块或路由机制实现，而非直接依赖。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"公开-api-控制\">公开 API 控制</h2><p>Swift 的访问控制修饰符是模块边界的第一道防线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// ✅ 模块公开 API — 使用 public&#10;public protocol PaymentServiceProtocol {&#10;    func processPayment(amount: Decimal, currency: String) async throws -&gt; PaymentResult&#10;}&#10;&#10;public struct PaymentResult {&#10;    public let transactionId: String&#10;    public let status: PaymentStatus&#10;    public let timestamp: Date&#10;&#10;    public init(transactionId: String, status: PaymentStatus, timestamp: Date) {&#10;        self.transactionId = transactionId&#10;        self.status = status&#10;        self.timestamp = timestamp&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public enum PaymentStatus {&#10;    case success&#10;    case pending&#10;    case failed(reason: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ❌ 模块内部实现 — 使用 internal 或 private&#10;final class StripePaymentService: PaymentServiceProtocol {&#10;    private let apiKey: String&#10;    private let httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol&#10;&#10;    init(apiKey: String, httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol) {&#10;        self.apiKey = apiKey&#10;        self.httpClient = httpClient&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func processPayment(amount: Decimal, currency: String) async throws -&gt; PaymentResult {&#10;        let response = try await httpClient.post(&quot;/charges&quot;, body: [&#10;            &quot;amount&quot;: amount,&#10;            &quot;currency&quot;: currency&#10;        ])&#10;        return PaymentResult(&#10;            transactionId: response.id,&#10;            status: .success,&#10;            timestamp: Date()&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 模块公开 API — 使用 public</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentServiceProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Decimal, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PaymentResult</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transactionId: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status: PaymentStatus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timestamp: Date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transactionId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: PaymentStatus, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Date) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.transactionId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transactionId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.timestamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timestamp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> success</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pending</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> failed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reason: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 模块内部实现 — 使用 internal 或 private</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StripePaymentService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaymentServiceProtocol </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apiKey: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apiKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">httpClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: HTTPClientProtocol) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.apiKey </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apiKey</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.httpClient </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Decimal, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PaymentResult {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpClient.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/charges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PaymentResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            transactionId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: response.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .success,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>API 设计原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小暴露</td>\n<td>只暴露消费者需要的类型和方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议优先</td>\n<td>公开协议而非具体类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值类型优先</td>\n<td>公开 struct/enum 而非 class</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显式初始化器</td>\n<td>public 类型必须提供 public init</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"无环依赖原则-adp\">无环依赖原则（ADP）</h2><p>无环依赖原则（Acyclic Dependencies Principle）要求模块依赖图中不能存在环路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Bad[&quot;❌ 循环依赖&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;模块 A&quot;] --&gt; B1[&quot;模块 B&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt; C1[&quot;模块 C&quot;]&#10;        C1 --&gt; A1&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Good[&quot;✅ 无环依赖&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;模块 A&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;模块 B&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; C2[&quot;模块 C&quot;]&#10;        B2 --&gt; D2[&quot;模块 D&quot;]&#10;        C2 --&gt; D2&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    classDef bad fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;    classDef good fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class A1,B1,C1 bad&#10;    class A2,B2,C2,D2 good\">graph LR\n    subgraph Bad[\"❌ 循环依赖\"]\n        A1[\"模块 A\"] --&gt; B1[\"模块 B\"]\n        B1 --&gt; C1[\"模块 C\"]\n        C1 --&gt; A1\n    end\n\n    subgraph Good[\"✅ 无环依赖\"]\n        A2[\"模块 A\"] --&gt; B2[\"模块 B\"]\n        A2 --&gt; C2[\"模块 C\"]\n        B2 --&gt; D2[\"模块 D\"]\n        C2 --&gt; D2\n    end\n\n    classDef bad fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n    classDef good fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class A1,B1,C1 bad\n    class A2,B2,C2,D2 good</pre><p>打破循环依赖的策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 场景：模块 A 需要调用模块 B，模块 B 也需要通知模块 A&#10;// 解决方案：提取接口模块&#10;&#10;// InterfaceModule（共享接口）&#10;public protocol NotificationHandler: AnyObject {&#10;    func handleNotification(_ notification: AppNotification)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 模块 B — 依赖接口模块&#10;public final class NotificationCenter {&#10;    private weak var handler: NotificationHandler?&#10;&#10;    public init(handler: NotificationHandler) {&#10;        self.handler = handler&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public func dispatch(_ notification: AppNotification) {&#10;        handler?.handleNotification(notification)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 模块 A — 依赖接口模块并实现协议&#10;extension AppCoordinator: NotificationHandler {&#10;    public func handleNotification(_ notification: AppNotification) {&#10;        switch notification {&#10;        case .userLoggedOut:&#10;            navigateToLogin()&#10;        case .deepLink(let url):&#10;            handleDeepLink(url)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 场景：模块 A 需要调用模块 B，模块 B 也需要通知模块 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 解决方案：提取接口模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// InterfaceModule（共享接口）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AnyObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleNotification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notification: AppNotification)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 模块 B — 依赖接口模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationCenter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> weak</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handler: NotificationHandler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: NotificationHandler) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.handler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notification: AppNotification) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#2